---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Web Grouth | Guest Posting for USA & UK" description="Meet Web Grouth, a guest posting partner for USA and UK campaigns with a 40,000+ publisher network, human support and clear live-link reporting." pageType="AboutPage">
  <div class="saas-page">
    <section class="saas-hero">
      <div class="shell saas-hero-grid">
        <div class="saas-hero-copy" data-reveal>
          <div class="saas-breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>About</span></div>
          <span class="saas-kicker">Guest posting agency</span>
          <h1>Guest posting made simple, clear and reliable.</h1>
          <p>Web Grouth helps brands and SEO agencies find relevant websites for USA and UK campaigns, publish guest posts and receive clear reports.</p>
          <div class="saas-hero-actions"><a class="saas-button primary" href="/order">Place an order ↗</a><a class="saas-button secondary" href="/contact">Talk to Web Grouth</a></div>
        </div>
        <aside class="saas-hero-panel" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          <span>Web Grouth in numbers</span>
          <ul><li>Website network <span>40,000+ websites</span></li><li>Main services <span>Guest posts and link insertions</span></li><li>Simple process <span>Review, approve, publish</span></li><li>Order support <span>Single and bulk</span></li><li>Primary markets <span>USA and UK</span></li></ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-section">
      <div class="shell metric-row" data-reveal>
        <article><strong>40,000+</strong><span>websites in popular niches</span></article>
        <article><strong>5,000+</strong><span>client orders handled</span></article>
        <article><strong>30 days</strong><span>indexing support on eligible orders</span></article>
        <article><strong>6 months</strong><span>replacement cover on eligible links</span></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-section white">
      <div class="shell story-grid">
        <div class="story-sticky" data-reveal><span class="saas-kicker">Why we started</span><h2>Big website lists need real human support.</h2><p>A good backlink is not only about high metrics. The website, topic, audience and target page should also make sense together.</p></div>
        <div class="story-copy" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
          <p>Many guest posting services send clients a huge spreadsheet and leave them to choose alone. This wastes time and makes it hard to know which website is right.</p>
          <p>Web Grouth starts with your niche, target URL, anchor, country, metrics and budget. We then select suitable options from our network of 40,000+ websites and explain the key details before work starts.</p>
          <p>Eligible orders may also use our pay-after-live option. You approve the website and terms first, then receive a live URL that is easy to check. Our goal is simple: make guest posting clear, safe and dependable.</p>
          <div class="value-grid">
            <article class="value-card"><span>01</span><h3>Human website matching</h3><p>We check your full needs instead of looking at only one metric.</p></article>
            <article class="value-card"><span>02</span><h3>Clear approval</h3><p>You confirm the website, price, content and terms before work starts.</p></article>
            <article class="value-card"><span>03</span><h3>Checked delivery</h3><p>You receive a working live URL that you can open and check.</p></article>
            <article class="value-card"><span>04</span><h3>Ongoing support</h3><p>We support single orders, bulk orders and regular agency campaigns.</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-section navy">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="saas-heading"><span class="saas-kicker">Why clients trust us</span><h2>Clear work builds real trust.</h2><p>We earn trust through honest terms, human support and delivery you can check.</p></div>
        <div class="trust-grid">
          <article class="trust-card" data-reveal><span>01 · CLEAR TERMS</span><h3>Know the details first</h3><p>We confirm the link type, content, delivery time, price and cover before work starts.</p></article>
          <article class="trust-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><span>02 · CHECKED DELIVERY</span><h3>Open the live link</h3><p>You receive a working published URL that you can open and check yourself.</p></article>
          <article class="trust-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><span>03 · HONEST SERVICE</span><h3>No false promises</h3><p>We deliver the agreed placement, but no honest agency can promise exact Google rankings.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-section slate">
      <div class="shell inner-cta" data-reveal><div><span>NEXT STEP</span><h2>Send your order and review the right websites.</h2></div><a class="saas-button primary" href="/order">Place an order ↗</a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
